        # **Fluent UFCS & Artist Method Chains**: Left-to-right method chaining for UV warping, texture sampling, Photoshop-style blend modes, color grading, and IEEE-754 bitcasts.
        #
        # Deeply nested shader calls like `blend_overlay_rgba(hue_shift_rgba(adjust_contrast_rgba(texture(tex, uv), 1.15), 0.08), tint, 0.65)` are hard to read and edit. CRShader supports left-to-right fluent method chains backed by automatic `TreeShaker` dependency injection:
