        # - **`.gdshaderinc` Emitter**: Strips `shader_type`, `render_mode`, and processor entry points (`vertex`/`fragment`/`light`), closes trailing `group_uniforms;`, and wraps structs, constants, uniforms, varyings, and helpers in `#ifndef <NAME>_GDSHADERINC`.
